module": "手机号登录", "item_type": "rule", "content": "验证码为6位数字，由系统生成并通过短信发送", "priority": "P0", "source_case_ids": ["TC001", "TC003", "TC008"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T22:00:52.476983+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_94fda52f_手机号登录_7208462648995554453", "module": "手机号登录", "item_type": "rule", "content": "手机号格式校验：必须为11位纯数字，不足11位或包含非数字字符均提示格式错误", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC006", "TC035"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T22:00:52.476999+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_94fda52f_手机号登录_6332822723089267799", "module": "手机号登录", "item_type": "rule", "content": "密码大小写敏感：输入密码必须与注册密码大小写完全一致", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC036"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T22:00:52.477014+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_94fda52f_手机号登录_8641682974884146060", "module": "手机号登录", "item_type": "rule", "content": "账号锁定后30分钟自动解锁，解锁后可用正确密码重新登录", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC038"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T22:00:52.477033+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_94fda52f_手机号登录_-5086340565479898748", "module": "手机号登录", "item_type": "boundary", "content": "验证码有效期为5分钟，5分钟整（含）即过期，此后使用该验证码登录会提示已过期", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC005", "TC007"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T22:00:52.477226+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_94fda52f_手机号登录_5024980997315308089", "module": "手机号登录", "item_type": "boundary", "content": "验证码000000为有效边界值，可作为正常验证码完成登录", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC008"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T22:00:52.477285+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_94fda52f_手机号登录_-456579822438576212", "module": "手机号登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "输入错误验证码时提示「验证码错误」，停留在登录页面，验证码输入框内容保留", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC004"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T22:00:52.477317+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_94fda52f_手机号登录_7179379853737636195", "module": "手机号登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "输入过期验证码时提示「验证码已过期，请重新获取」，登录失败停留在当前页面", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC005", "TC007"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T22:00:52.477335+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_94fda52f_手机号登录_1989638586236244909", "module": "手机号登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "手机号格式不符合11位纯数字要求时提示「请输入正确的手机号格式」，获取验证码或登录按钮不可用", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC006", "TC035"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T22:00:52.477360+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_94fda52f_手机号登录_4068822085152697713", "module": "手机号登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "密码登录时手机号为空提示「请输入手机号」，登录按钮不可用", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC033"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T22:00:52.477426+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_94fda52f_手机号登录_-6528721521827836773", "module": "手机号登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "密码登录时密码为空提示「请输入密码」，登录按钮不可用，停留在登录页面", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC034"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T22:00:52.477456+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_94fda52f_手机号登录_8333594133111504985", "module": "手机号登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "密码登录时输入错误密码提示「密码错误」，登录失败停留在登录页面", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC036"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T22:00:52.477484+00:00"}], "changes": []}
