nt": "不同手机号独立计算每日发送上限，互不影响", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC033"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.571416+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_7c295c73a36d", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "rule", "content": "连续5次输入错误验证码触发风控限制，提示操作过于频繁", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC039"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.571436+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_cfd14a33c781", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "rule", "content": "登录接口具备防重放攻击机制，同一请求包不可重复使用", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC044"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.571453+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_684bb22e3dbe", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "rule", "content": "验证码仅通过短信发送，响应体和日志中不得包含验证码明文", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC041"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.571470+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_6e57e4413b8c", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "boundary", "content": "验证码有效期边界：4分59秒内有效，5分钟整过期，5分01秒过期", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC013", "TC014", "TC015"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.571486+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_df731de890b5", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "boundary", "content": "验证码发送间隔边界：59秒失败，60秒整成功，61秒成功", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC016", "TC017", "TC018"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.571501+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_c5c26185ef3f", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "boundary", "content": "每日发送次数边界：第10次成功，第11次达上限", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC019", "TC020"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.572894+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_7aa589c8d3f7", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "boundary", "content": "手机号位数边界：10位和12位均提示格式错误", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC021", "TC022"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573016+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_6539d50202ce", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "网络异常时获取验证码或登录均提示网络异常请重试", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC007", "TC026", "TC027"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573035+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_556f41d608d0", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "输入错误验证码时提示验证码错误，可等待60秒后重新获取正确验证码登录", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC012", "TC101"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573053+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_62911e3f2f53", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "验证码发送失败时服务端记录日志，用户可联系客服处理", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC103"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573071+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_a48727b312b6", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "验证码已发送但未收到短信时可等待60秒后重新获取", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC102"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573087+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_1a3a23d69337", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "短时间内大量调用验证码发送接口触发防刷限流机制", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC040"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573104+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_b61fe8aa45e4", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "接口响应时间需在预期范围内（如小于2秒）", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC042"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573121+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_30e09276a6f1", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "手机号为空时提示请输入手机号，验证码为空时提示请输入验证码", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC034", "TC035"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573137+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_ca3b9b93dd9b", "module": "手机号验证码登录", "item_type": "exception", "content": "验证码位数不足6位或含字母/特殊字符时提示格式错误", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC036", "TC037", "TC038"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573154+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_c5c606a9987e", "module": "新用户注册", "item_type": "feature", "content": "新用户输入手机号和验证码后跳转至信息补全页面，填写账号名称和头像后完成注册并自动登录跳转首页", "priority": "P0", "source_case_ids": ["TC045", "TC050", "TC098", "TC099"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573170+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_6e4827a68e3a", "module": "新用户注册", "item_type": "feature", "content": "信息补全页面点击取消或返回则返回登录页，不生成注册记录", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC100"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573187+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_11620005f4da", "module": "新用户注册", "item_type": "rule", "content": "账号名称和头像均为必填项，任一为空时提示不能为空", "priority": "P0", "source_case_ids": ["TC046", "TC047", "TC048"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573204+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_ca1d87be00f3", "module": "新用户注册", "item_type": "rule", "content": "已注册手机号不可重复注册，提示手机号已注册", "priority": "P0", "source_case_ids": ["TC049"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573220+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_d162e173a6fe", "module": "新用户注册", "item_type": "rule", "content": "账号名称支持中英文数字组合，不支持特殊字符，含敏感词时提示不合规", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC051", "TC052", "TC053"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573237+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_4fde3dac6949", "module": "新用户注册", "item_type": "rule", "content": "账号名称长度限制为1-20个字符", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC054", "TC055"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573253+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_033184503091", "module": "新用户注册", "item_type": "rule", "content": "头像仅支持图片格式，大小限制为5MB以内", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC056", "TC057"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573330+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_313896ded94c", "module": "新用户注册", "item_type": "exception", "content": "注册时验证码错误或过期分别提示验证码错误和验证码已过期", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC060", "TC061"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573350+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_3c5f90da2ea3", "module": "新用户注册", "item_type": "exception", "content": "头像上传中断或服务器错误时提示上传失败", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC058", "TC059"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573366+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_07af19df2b19", "module": "新用户注册", "item_type": "exception", "content": "网络异常时无法获取验证码，提示网络异常请稍后重试", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC062"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573384+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_813b0ad55542", "module": "用户注销", "item_type": "feature", "content": "用户提交注销申请后进入7个工作日观察期，观察期内未登录则自动完成注销", "priority": "P0", "source_case_ids": ["TC063", "TC064", "TC065"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573400+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_815fed020279", "module": "用户注销", "item_type": "feature", "content": "观察期内任意一次登录均停止注销流程并恢复账号正常状态，观察期从最近登录日重新计算", "priority": "P0", "source_case_ids": ["TC066", "TC069", "TC070", "TC072", "TC075", "TC077"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573416+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_675ad8860384", "module": "用户注销", "item_type": "feature", "content": "注销完成后原账号无法登录，提示账号已注销", "priority": "P0", "source_case_ids": ["TC067", "TC068", "TC071"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573432+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_82b40130cc5e", "module": "用户注销", "item_type": "rule", "content": "观察期7个工作日正确排除周末和法定节假日（如春节、国庆等）", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC073", "TC107", "TC108"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573447+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_63e228b5ffdd", "module": "用户注销", "item_type": "rule", "content": "注销完成后用户个人数据脱敏或清除（手机号、头像、昵称等），不可恢复", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC078"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573463+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_1ee2c0acef63", "module": "用户注销", "item_type": "rule", "content": "注销完成后无法通过找回密码恢复账号", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC076"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573480+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_522f5351a151", "module": "用户注销", "item_type": "rule", "content": "观察期内部分核心功能（发布内容、修改个人信息等）受限", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC104"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573497+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_940fd13079e2", "module": "用户注销", "item_type": "exception", "content": "网络异常时提交注销申请不生成注销记录，提示网络异常请稍后重试", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC074"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573513+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_0f290106a078", "module": "首页访问控制", "item_type": "feature", "content": "未登录用户可正常浏览首页全部内容，点击任意可交互元素（按钮、链接、图片、文章标题等）均跳转至登录页", "priority": "P0", "source_case_ids": ["TC079", "TC080", "TC081", "TC082", "TC083", "TC084", "TC089", "TC091"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573529+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_1e8ec405ce19", "module": "首页访问控制", "item_type": "feature", "content": "已登录用户点击首页可交互元素正常跳转至目标页面", "priority": "P0", "source_case_ids": ["TC085", "TC086", "TC087", "TC088"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573543+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_bf224a950f34", "module": "首页访问控制", "item_type": "feature", "content": "未登录用户点击内容跳转登录页后登录成功，自动返回之前点击的内容详情页", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC090", "TC095"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573559+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_87a72781cb4a", "module": "首页访问控制", "item_type": "feature", "content": "已登录用户退出登录后首页内容正常展示，点击元素跳转登录页", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC105"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573575+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_463d39a45fed", "module": "首页访问控制", "item_type": "rule", "content": "未登录用户通过直接URL访问内容详情页时校验登录状态，未登录则跳转登录页", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC096"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573594+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_db141ea18066", "module": "首页访问控制", "item_type": "rule", "content": "登录态过期后点击首页元素跳转登录页并提示登录已过期", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC092"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573612+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_d1fc39e963d3", "module": "首页访问控制", "item_type": "rule", "content": "跳转登录页时URL不携带用户敏感信息（手机号、密码等）", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC097"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573628+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_4a23bb2f747c", "module": "首页访问控制", "item_type": "exception", "content": "网络异常时未登录用户点击元素走离线处理逻辑不跳转登录页，已登录用户给出加载失败提示", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC093", "TC094"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573644+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_171b22e35167", "module": "首页访问控制", "item_type": "exception", "content": "已注销账号访问首页行为与未登录用户一致，点击内容跳转登录页", "priority": "P1", "source_case_ids": ["TC109"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573660+00:00"}, {"id": "kb_1705657b_78c2e0ff45e6", "module": "首页访问控制", "item_type": "exception", "content": "未登录与已登录状态下首页加载时间均在可接受范围内", "priority": "P2", "source_case_ids": ["TC106"], "status": "active", "old_content": "", "change_reason": "", "created_at": "2026-06-15T21:35:13.573676+00:00"}], "changes": []}
